; Hand-authored practice sections for "His Mercy Is More" (Sing! 2023 live).
; Used to debug the sections reader; see docs/practice-mode.md for the format.
;
; This chart is the awkward case on purpose: a 1/4 pickup (bar 001), 6/4 throughout
; (#nnn02: 1.5) with single 3/4 turnaround bars at 030, 051 and 087, and a ritardando
; in bar 095 that puts SIX BPM chips inside one bar.
;
; Bar numbers are .dtx file bar numbers - the nnn in "#nnn13:" - not the game's
; internal ones. End positions are exclusive: a section ends where the next begins.

#VERSION: 1
#BARBASE: DTX
#LEADBARS: 1

#SECTION: 000,009,Intro (no drums)
#SECTION: 009,014,Verse 1
#SECTION: 014,020,Verse 2 (hats)
#SECTION: 020,030,Chorus 1
#SECTION: 030,031,Turnaround 1 (3/4),0
#SECTION: 031,039,Verse 3
#SECTION: 039,042,Verse 4 (hats)
#SECTION: 042,051,Chorus 2
#SECTION: 051,052,Turnaround 2 (3/4),0
#SECTION: 052,060,Chorus 3
#SECTION: 060,063,Breakdown (drums out)
#SECTION: 063,069,Bridge build
#SECTION: 069,078,Chorus 4
#SECTION: 078,081,Quiet
#SECTION: 081,088,Build
#SECTION: 088,096,Final chorus
#SECTION: 096,099,Outro (rit.)
